          "quote": "“Securing this $116-million agreement represents a major milestone for NeoVolta, and we believe this is only the beginning of a much larger growth trajectory for our company,” said Ardes Johnson, CEO of NeoVolta. “As we scale production in Georgia and fulfill these commitments, we are building the foundation for rapid, sustained growth while positioning NeoVolta to meet the accelerating demand for domestically manufactured battery energy storage systems and become one of the leading U.S. suppliers in the industry.”"
